Draw what a focus listener invalidates in the next frame

A window runs its focus listeners as the last step of a draw, once the
frame is built and swapped in. A view notified there was only marked
dirty: no frame was scheduled and no observer heard of it, so a popover a
listener closed as focus left it stayed drawn until something else asked
for a frame. Treat a notify from a focus listener as one made outside a
draw, scheduling the next frame.

